+	 *
+	 *   pll_ssc_mode = (1<<20) | (1<<8) | ([strength] << 4) | [mode],
+	 *      ppm = strength * 500
+	 *      mode: 0=center, 1=up, 2=down
+	 *
+	 *   eg:
+	 *     1. config 1000ppm center ss. then mode=0, strength=2
+	 *        .pll_ssc_mode = (1<<20) | (1<<8) | (2 << 4) | 0,
+	 *     2. config 3000ppm down ss. then mode=2, strength=6
